# A great run on Russian Hill (the score tiers' measure): the long handrail down the crooked block's north
# side every 10 s (the teleport stands in for walking back up): a boneless onto it near its top, a nosegrind
# down it (53 m, 12.7 m of drop) and a 360 flip off just before its foot, LOMBARD HANDRAIL on the pop:
# 9,524; twelve, 114,288. Pro (17,500) on the second, Sick (104,000) on the eleventh. A decent run (the
# handrail as a plain 50-50 to its end, 2,996, every 20 s) scores 17,976.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level russianhill
bot balance
